Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么早又怎么了？你又要埋我的牲畜吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it now this early? You're going to bury my livestock again?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.21,0:01:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是，只是例行检查，现场有个小泄漏。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.21,0:01:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, It's just a normal inspection, there's just a small leak at the site.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.21,0:01:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，继续前进。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.21,0:01:39.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go ahead, move along.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.21,0:01:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么这样对我？就像上次一样？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.21,0:01:48.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you doing this to me? Just like the last time?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.54,0:01:55.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证，这次不会，现在走吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.54,0:01:55.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise, not this time, now move along.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:55.75,0:01:56.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.75,0:01:56.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.67,0:02:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是糟糕的一天，糟糕的早晨，还有什么...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.67,0:02:09.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What a really bad day, rough morning, what more. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:02:15.67,0:02:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.67,0:02:16.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:17.67,0:02:18.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}诶。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.67,0:02:18.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Eh.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:28.62,0:02:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，拜托。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.62,0:02:29.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.62,0:02:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对我来说真是艰难的一天。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.62,0:02:42.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What a really rough day for me.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:31.17,0:03:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}釜山行
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.17,0:03:35.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}TRAIN TO BUSAN
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.50,0:03:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士，
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.50,0:03:38.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Madame,
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.83,0:03:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}统计数据公司显示股市异常。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.83,0:03:42.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Statistical data companies we showed abnormal in stock market.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.00,0:03:45.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请不要现在撤资。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.00,0:03:45.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please do not take your investment now.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.75,0:03:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一旦你撤资，市场就会下跌。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.75,0:03:47.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The market will fall once you've taken your investment.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.33,0:03:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，我明白。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.33,0:03:49.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:50.21,0:03:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感谢您的考虑。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.21,0:03:51.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for your consideration.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.04,0:03:57.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不是的。我会尽快做。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.04,0:03:57.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it is not. I will do it as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:59.33,0:04:00.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.33,0:04:00.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.83,0:04:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会按照您的意愿运行。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.83,0:04:02.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It will be run according to your wishes.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.75,0:04:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请保重！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.75,0:04:04.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please take care!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:21.92,0:04:22.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来我办公室。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.92,0:04:22.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come into my office.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:40.46,0:04:41.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么事？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.46,0:04:41.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What is the matter?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.08,0:04:43.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卖掉我们所有的股票资产。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.08,0:04:43.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sell all of our assets in the stock market.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:44.12,0:04:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全部卖掉？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.12,0:04:45.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Selling it all?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:45.75,0:04:46.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.75,0:04:46.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那样做是不是太冒险了？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't it too risky to do that?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:50.21,0:04:51.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们还能保住首要资产。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.21,0:04:51.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Still we could maintain our first asset.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:52.08,0:04:53.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后等待更好的...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.08,0:04:53.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And wait if something better. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.54,0:04:54.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金先生...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.54,0:04:54.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Kim. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:04:54.88,0:04:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.88,0:04:55.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:56.21,0:04:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就按我说的做。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.21,0:04:57.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just do what I tell you to do.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:00.62,0:05:02.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们必须警惕可能发生的情况。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.62,0:05:02.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We must be watchful of the possibility that happen.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.88,0:05:04.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.88,0:05:04.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay...
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.88,0:05:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下，金先生...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.88,0:05:08.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait a minute Mr. Kim. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.54,0:05:14.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在孩子们流行的礼物是什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.54,0:05:14.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the popular gift for kids nowadays?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:20.54,0:05:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算了。你真的当不好秀安的爸爸。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.54,0:05:22.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Forget it. You really can't be a good dad to Su-an.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.25,0:05:24.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你连她的演出都没去。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.25,0:05:24.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't even attend her recital.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:25.00,0:05:26.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没忘。这里工作很多。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.00,0:05:26.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I did not forget that. There's a lot of work here.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.12,0:05:28.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她可以和我一起留在首尔。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.12,0:05:28.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She can stay here in Seoul with me.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你带秀安去釜山她会高兴的。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Soo-an will be happy when you bring her to Busan.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.33,0:05:33.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她生日你又要买礼物吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.33,0:05:33.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you going to buy her gifts again for her birthday?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:34.17,0:05:36.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该听她一次，而不是光送礼物。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.17,0:05:36.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You should listen to her once instead of giving her gifts.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.75,0:05:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次你能实现她的愿望吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.75,0:05:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you keep her wish this time?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:39.25,0:05:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，我保证我们去釜山。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.25,0:05:40.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes I promise we'll go to Busan.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不信你的承诺。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't trust your promise.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.17,0:05:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.17,0:05:45.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.17,0:05:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}遵守你的承诺。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.17,0:05:47.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your promise.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}秀安厌倦了所有的承诺...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Soo-an is tired of all the promising. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算了，我再跟你说..
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Never mind, I'll talk to you. .
Dialogue: 2,0:05:51.38,0:05:53.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道明天是她生日吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.38,0:05:53.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that it's her birthday tomorrow right?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.21,0:05:55.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.21,0:05:55.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Iknow!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:24.00,0:06:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，我拿着这个。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.00,0:06:25.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, I'll hold this.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.50,0:06:26.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢..
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.50,0:06:26.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. .
Dialogue: 2,0:06:27.04,0:06:27.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在哪？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.04,0:06:27.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is she?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.00,0:06:32.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在房间玩..
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.00,0:06:32.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She's in her room playing. .
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.88,0:06:37.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们什么时候去那里？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.88,0:06:37.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}When will we go there?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.25,0:06:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈，你和爸爸说了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.25,0:06:39.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Mom, did you talk to dad?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:45.25,0:06:47.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 我要挂电话了，他来了。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.25,0:06:47.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- I'm gonna hang the phone now, he's here.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事，你可以跟她说。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay you can talk to her.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 我已经挂了。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- I already hung-up.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:06.92,0:07:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你妈妈之前打电话给我。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.92,0:07:09.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Your mother called me earlier.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:10.79,0:07:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸答应带你去釜山。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.79,0:07:13.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad promised that he will take you to Busan.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.33,0:07:17.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但在此之前，我有事情要做。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.33,0:07:17.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But before that, there are things I have to do.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.62,0:07:19.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以秀安要耐心点。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.62,0:07:19.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So Suo-an needs to be patient.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:28.21,0:07:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.21,0:07:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Here
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.04,0:07:37.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为我忘了？生日快乐。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.04,0:07:37.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You thought I forgot? Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.21,0:07:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，打开看看。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.21,0:07:39.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, open it.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，不喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, you don't like it?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:13.75,0:08:15.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 去年儿童节也是。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.75,0:08:15.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- Last year on children's day too.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:19.75,0:08:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那告诉我你想要什么。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.75,0:08:24.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, tell me what you want.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:26.25,0:08:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 釜山
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.25,0:08:27.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Busan
Dialogue: 2,0:08:27.75,0:08:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 我想去釜山找妈妈。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.75,0:08:30.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- I want to go to mom at Busan.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:30.75,0:08:31.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.75,0:08:31.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tomorrow...
Dialogue: 2,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，等等
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, just wait
Dialogue: 2,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等爸爸忙完事情我们一定去...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We definitely there after affair father finished. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:08:35.88,0:08:36.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.88,0:08:36.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No...
Dialogue: 2,0:08:37.17,0:08:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.17,0:08:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tomorrow...
Dialogue: 2,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸总是说下次去。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad always say we'll go next time.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:41.50,0:08:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管怎样，明天我们必须去...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.50,0:08:42.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, tomorrow we have to go. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.46,0:08:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不必跟我来。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.46,0:08:45.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have to come with me.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就实现我一次愿望吧...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Grant my wish for once. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.75,0:08:57.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}工作很多吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.75,0:08:57.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there a lot of work?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:58.04,0:08:58.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，很多。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.04,0:08:58.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes there is.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.71,0:09:03.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明天要去釜山吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.71,0:09:03.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you going to Busan tomorrow?
Dialogue: 2,0:09:04.88,0:09:05.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.88,0:09:05.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.96,0:09:11.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做得很好。到了那里试着和你妻子谈谈。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.96,0:09:11.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You did good. Try talking with your wife when you arrive there.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:13.08,0:09:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样分手不好。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.08,0:09:16.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not good if you just break-up like that.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:17.08,0:09:18.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩应该重新在一起。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.08,0:09:18.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You two should re-unite again.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:19.08,0:09:23.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们重新在一起没什么不对...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.08,0:09:23.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There is nothing wrong you are together again. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:09:26.12,0:09:28.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次试试，这样你就能回来...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.12,0:09:28.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Try it this time so that you can come back again. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.42,0:09:29.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}母亲...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.42,0:09:29.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Mother...
Dialogue: 2,0:09:29.75,0:09:31.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想谈这个。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.75,0:09:31.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.42,0:09:35.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让它过去吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.42,0:09:35.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let it stay in the past.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:37.88,0:09:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.88,0:09:38.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:39.75,0:09:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别太忙于工作。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.75,0:09:41.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't get too busy with work.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.54,0:09:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候，生活不一定非要偏重一边。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.54,0:09:46.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes, life isn't necessarily have to be on one side.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:47.92,0:09:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}享受你的生活。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.92,0:09:48.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Enjoy your life.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:51.25,0:09:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住你的家人。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.25,0:09:54.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember your family.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:37.58,0:10:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}秀安，打起精神来。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.58,0:10:39.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come Soo's spirit.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续唱……
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep singing. .
Dialogue: 2,0:10:43.58,0:10:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为秀安鼓掌！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.58,0:10:46.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Applause for Soo-an!
Dialogue: 2,0:11:00.88,0:11:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈，好，妈妈。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.88,0:11:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Mom, okay mom.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:04.42,0:11:09.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们已经在路上了，再见。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.42,0:11:09.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We're on our way now, see you.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:28.54,0:11:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那首歌，你怎么没唱完？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.54,0:11:32.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That song, why didn't you finished singing it?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:33.50,0:11:36.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么知道？你又不在场。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.50,0:11:36.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you know? You weren't there.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:37.54,0:11:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸一直都知道你在做什么
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.54,0:11:41.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad always knew what you've been doing
Dialogue: 2,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是只顾工作。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't just focus on work.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:45.25,0:11:47.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我也关心你。  -好。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.25,0:11:47.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I focus on you too.   -Okay
Dialogue: 2,0:11:48.88,0:11:52.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你唱得很好。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.88,0:11:52.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You sing good.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.96,0:11:55.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你说，钱不会给我们自己带来幸福。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.96,0:11:55.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll tell you, money does not bring happiness to ourselves.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:57.62,0:11:59.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永远记住这一点……
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.62,0:11:59.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember it always. .
Dialogue: 2,0:12:11.46,0:12:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊……好险。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.46,0:12:12.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ahh. . That was close.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:17.33,0:12:19.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.33,0:12:19.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:26.79,0:12:28.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}秀安，你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.79,0:12:28.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Soo-an, are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:29.50,0:12:30.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.50,0:12:30.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What'shappening?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:43.08,0:12:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，我们真的得继续走了。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.08,0:12:44.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, we really need to keep going.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:58.79,0:13:02.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有出发的乘客，请现在上车
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.79,0:13:02.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All departing passengers, kindly board the train now
Dialogue: 2,0:13:03.12,0:13:06.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本次列车即将开往釜山。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.12,0:13:06.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}as this train is now ready to depart for Busan.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:08.71,0:13:09.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请问，南站怎么走？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.71,0:13:09.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, where is the south station?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:10.00,0:13:11.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 啊，南站，您得往那边走……
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.00,0:13:11.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- Ah, South station, you need to that way. .
Dialogue: 2,0:13:11.83,0:13:12.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.83,0:13:12.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:40.58,0:13:41.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教授
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.58,0:13:41.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kyo-shi
Dialogue: 2,0:13:42.25,0:13:44.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是？  -您的围巾。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.25,0:13:44.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes?   -Your scarf.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:50.75,0:13:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}路上请好好休息。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.75,0:13:54.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please rest during this trip.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:58.12,0:13:59.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，珍熙来了。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.12,0:13:59.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow, Jihee is here.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:03.38,0:14:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么呢，我跟你一起去。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.38,0:14:04.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean, I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你的啦啦队。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm your cheerleader.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:06.92,0:14:07.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家好。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.92,0:14:07.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How are you all?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:08.79,0:14:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好……
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.79,0:14:10.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good...
Dialogue: 2,0:14:11.75,0:14:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}终于……还有新面孔……
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.75,0:14:12.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Finally. . Also fresh eyes. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}终于……
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Finally...
Dialogue: 2,0:14:23.12,0:14:24.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，去找别的座位吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.12,0:14:24.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, go find another seat okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.50,0:14:27.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小气鬼，都不肯分享……
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.50,0:14:27.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stingy you did not want to share. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.75,0:14:29.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，要是见到我很高兴，就说声“谢谢”。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.75,0:14:29.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, if your thankful to see me, Just say "Thank you".
Dialogue: 2,0:14:30.71,0:14:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连“工具”都给你配齐了……
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.71,0:14:32.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Even the "tools" you also right for you. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:14:33.71,0:14:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说得对……
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.71,0:14:36.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She'sright...
Dialogue: 2,0:14:36.88,0:14:44.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接受她吧。接受她吧。接受她吧。接受她吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.88,0:14:44.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Accept her.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:47.12,0:14:49.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，吃这个。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.12,0:14:49.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, eat this.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:49.67,0:14:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟……
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.67,0:14:51.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Aigoo...
Dialogue: 2,0:14:51.42,0:14:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你哪来的鸡蛋？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.42,0:14:54.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you get that egg.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:54.33,0:14:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你自己吃吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.33,0:14:55.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Eat it yourself.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-吃这个。  -不，我不喜欢。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Eat this.   -No, I don't like.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.83,0:15:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-组长，您已经上车了吗？  -是，怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.83,0:15:01.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Chief, Are you already on board?   -Yes, but why?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:02.62,0:15:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}办公室出了点问题……交给我们就好……
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.62,0:15:07.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There are problems in the office. . . Let us take care of. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}really?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:10.46,0:15:12.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我回去再说。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.46,0:15:12.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll discuss it after I get back.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:13.62,0:15:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我午饭后到。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.62,0:15:15.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be there after lunch.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:16.17,0:15:17.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-回头见……  -好。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.17,0:15:17.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-See you later. . .   -Good.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:23.04,0:16:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-非常抱歉。  -非常抱歉……
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.04,0:16:25.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- I'm so sorry. .
Dialogue: 2,0:16:27.04,0:16:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请原谅我。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.04,0:16:29.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:30.04,0:16:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常抱歉。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.04,0:16:36.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:42.21,0:16:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-打扰一下。  -是？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.21,0:16:43.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Excuse me.   -Yes?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:44.83,0:16:46.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你是负责人吗？  -是。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.83,0:16:46.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you the one in charge?   -Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看到一个可疑的乘客
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've seen a suspicious passenger
Dialogue: 2,0:16:49.25,0:16:52.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乘客在哪？在洗手间里。
